/* ===================== Smart Import v3 (importer.js, loaded after setup.js) =====================
   Reads any CSV / TSV / TXT / XLSX / XLS / ODS file (every sheet) or a table pasted from Google Sheets / Excel, finds the real
   header row, recognises WHAT the file is (sales, returns, stock count, Amazon inventory, PI / purchase order, PI lines for an
   existing order, packing list / shipment, payments list, bank statement, products, parties) and WHICH column is which from a
   built-in dictionary (marketplace, supplier, forwarder and bank headers, Chinese PI words) with a confidence per mapping.
   Every value that is not already known (product, party, currency, channel, location…) becomes one decision card with ranked
   suggestions, "create new" or "skip"; decisions and mappings are remembered in Setup (importMemory, skuAliases, partyAliases,
   listAliases). Each row is validated in plain words, cells can be edited in the preview, and the commit writes everything in
   one batch with one IMP- document that Undo import reverses.
   Public names used by events.js / setup.js: vImport, handleImport, impSetKind, impSetDateFmt, impSetLoc, impMapChange,
   impAliasChange, impCancel, runImport, undoImport, buildPreview, renderImportPreview, autoMap, parseDate, resolveSku,
   findParty, findListItem, resolveLoc, resolveChannel, impNum, pastImports, ixAct, ixChange. */

